<title>HONG KONG: Credit Lyonnais sets warrants on HK Elec.</title>
<headline>Credit Lyonnais sets warrants on HK Elec.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Lyonnais Financial Products (Guernsey) Ltd said on Tuesday it has issued 380 million American-style call warrants on shares of Hongkong Electric Holdings Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$30.415	 PREMIUM	  21.8 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$0.3263	 GEARING	  8.47X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  07.JAN.98	 PAYDATE	  27.JAN.97</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG	 LISTING DATE   29.JAN.97</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE    HK$27.65	  MIN EXER LOT   5,000</p>
<p>NOTES: CASH SETTLEMENT OF EXERCISE AMOUNT PAYABLE IN HONG KONG DOLLAR OR PHYSICAL DELIVERY OF STOCKS AT ISSUER'S DISCRETION</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
